0..73 Comment "// The wheel of `model/circuit/circuit-feed-wheel.gandr`, run: a model of"
74..151 Comment "// `Wheel` gives `Nat` and `emit`, and driving `spin` over a stream reads the"
152..227 Comment "// outputs it feeds back. A model does not yet state a circuit rule, so the"
228..304 Comment "// model is refused and nothing runs. The refusal names the unit that builds"
305..311 Comment "// it."
